--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/ffmpeg-0087-avcodec-aac-do-not-overwrite-avctx-ch_layout-when-re.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>
+Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 07:19:20 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH 087/178] avcodec/aac: do not overwrite avctx->ch_layout when
+ restoring the output configuration
+
+ff_aac_output_configure() copies the restored layout into avctx->ch_layout,
+the plain assignment before it dropped whatever avctx->ch_layout owned.
+
+This is hardening, no leak was replicated.
+Found during the review of https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/24677
+
+(cherry picked from commit d314aa0c8fed9d99cc3aa77d2cc4078635b3c765)
+---
