+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>
+Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 05:28:20 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH 099/178] avcodec/exif: bound the parsed IFD entries by the
+ size of the EXIF buffer
+
+Every entry of a well formed IFD tree is a distinct 12 byte record
+inside the buffer, so a tree cannot have more entries than the buffer
+holds records. Count the parsed entries and reject the tree once that
+number is exceeded.
+
