+MIME-Version: 1.0
+Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
+Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
+
+For a RefPicList entry with Index7Bits 127 the DXVA H.264 specification
+reads AssociatedFlag as a non-existing (1) or a not available (0)
+picture, and references to a not available picture decode from mid-gray
