+RefFrameList does not hold, such as the one h264_refs.c substitutes for
+a missing reference, and the bottom field flag turned it into a
+non-existing picture in field pictures. Always use 0 for such entries.
+
+Signed-off-by: Kacper Michajłow <kasper93@gmail.com>
