+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Alexei Podtelezhnikov <apodtele@gmail.com>
+Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:49:55 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH 5/5] * src/truetype/ttgxvar.c
+ (tt_var_load_item_variation_store): Update 2.
+
+Note again that ( region_count * axis_count ) does not overflow or
+wrap around as those are 15- and 16-bit values. "Six" does it.
